menu "Integer denoiser kernels"

config EDN_S3_SIMD_DOT
    bool "Use ESP32-S3 signed INT8 SIMD dot products"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
    default n
    help
        Accelerate supported dense rows with pinned ESP-NN assembly while
        preserving the portable runtime's exact requantization. Alignment,
        readable guards, and scalar tails are handled by the adapter.
        The benchmark executes a known-answer self-test before measuring.
        Disabled by default until verified on the intended physical board.

endmenu
